/**
 * @file impedance.cnl
 * Test case for linNet.
 *
 * This test case applies a passive RLC filter to demonstrate, how the
 * complex in- and output impedance of a circuit can be calculated. It is
 * an example from the linNet manual, see Chapter 8, Typical Use Cases,
 * for a discussion.
