U Uin K1 gnd
DEF Uout K2 gnd

PLOT G   Uout Uin
PLOT Zin Uin I_Uin

I Iload gnd K2
PLOT Zout Uout Iload

C C  K1 K2
R Rc K1 K2
L L  K2 gnd
R Rl K2 gnd